{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spear","model_identifier":"spear","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## spear\n\nPolearm, bronze tier.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 128x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -1.8..1.8, z -69.5..15.0 (size 1.5 x 3.5 x 84.5 u = 4 x 10 x 238 cm).\nBronze spear, about 2.1 m (84.5 u incl. head): socketed leaf blade on an ash shaft. Grip (rear hand, slot_hand_r) at the origin, 14 u from the butt, point forward (-Z). **Second grip (left hand) 11.5 u forward along the shaft** (matches warrior_base guard_polearm / attack_polearm_thrust). Edges/flats up-down (+/-Y).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `spear_bronze.png`\n"},"description":"## spear\n\nPolearm, bronze tier.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 128x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -1.8..1.8, z -69.5..15.0 (size 1.5 x 3.5 x 84.5 u = 4 x 10 x 238 cm).\nBronze spear, about 2.1 m (84.5 u incl. head): socketed leaf blade on an ash shaft. Grip (rear hand, slot_hand_r) at the origin, 14 u from the butt, point forward (-Z). **Second grip (left hand) 11.5 u forward along the shaft** (matches warrior_base guard_polearm / attack_polearm_thrust). Edges/flats up-down (+/-Y).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `spear_bronze.png`\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.5,-57.0],"to":[0.5,0.5,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[79,71,80.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[52,0,123.0,1.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[80,71,81.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,71,71.0,72.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1.0,71.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[1,0,2.0,71.0],"texture":0